### 1. POST - Enviar Áudio para a IA (Multipart)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/ai
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-2.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-2.m4a
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 2. POST - Criar Transação Manual (JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compras no Farmacia Cleide",
  "category": "PHARMA",
  "amount": 978989  
}

###

### 3. GET - Listar Transações por Categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions


###

### 4. GET - Buscar Transação por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/id/1

###

### 5. PUT - Atualizar Transação por ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermercado Mensal",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "type": "EXPENSE"
}

###

### 6. PATCH - Atualização Parcial
PATCH http://localhost:8080/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 175.00
}

###

### 7. DELETE - Deletar Transação por ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transactions/1




### 8. POST - Enviar Áudio para a IA (Multipart)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/ai HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-2.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-2.m4a
------boundary--

###
